msgstr "Text len pre neanglojazyčné preklady"

#: ../../contributors_manual/krita_manual_conventions.rst:558
msgid ""
"You can use the following to include text that only makes sense for non-"
"English translations of the manual, for example to provide non-English "
"readers with the English names of an item for reference::"
msgstr ""
"Pomocou nasledujúceho môžete zahrnúť text, ktorý má zmysel iba pre "
